### =============================================================
### Autenticación (ejecutar primero el login que se necesite)
### Los demás archivos .http hacen su propio login con "# @name".
### =============================================================
@host = http://localhost:9090/api

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "administrador",
    "password": "Admin2026#"
}
###

# @name loginVendedor
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "vendedor01",
    "password": "Ventas2026#"
}
###

# @name loginBodeguero
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "bodeguero01",
    "password": "Bodega2026#"
}
###

### Perfil del usuario dueño del token
GET {{host}}/auth/perfil
Authorization: Bearer {{loginVendedor.response.body.token}}
###

### Error 401: credenciales inválidas
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "administrador",
    "password": "incorrecta"
}
###

### Error 401: sin token
GET {{host}}/productos
###
